# UI

- Use shadcn/ui as the base component set.
- Keep forms and tables consistent (shared Form + DataTable patterns).
- Design mobile-first, enhance for desktop; optimize counter flows for desktop.
- Maintain WCAG AA accessibility.
- Enterprise minimal look: no purple gradients, no marketing heroes, no emoji icons (use lucide).
- Follow `docs/design.md` tokens (teal accent, IBM Plex / Source Sans).
